  "notes": "EIC investment income: line 2a, line 2b, line 3b, and the positive part of line 7a. A loss contributes 0. Core v68 reads the rounded line 2b (tax.us.2025.interest.line-2b), not the Schedule B Part I total, so a total that carries cents is rounded once before this rule adds it; the arithmetic is otherwise unchanged and a whole-dollar value is identical."
